# The frozen episode-level evidence behind the paper's panel tables.
# `data/evaluation/exam/` stays ignored (ablations, aborted runs, backups);
# this is the twenty-six reported cells only, gzipped, with a manifest.
!data/evaluation/exam_evidence/
!data/evaluation/exam_evidence/*.jsonl.gz
!data/evaluation/exam_evidence/MANIFEST.json
# The two judge passes ship as one file each. The per-batch files they were
# merged from are working state: same records, split by the batch that was
# being judged at the time, and named for it.
data/release/*_rejudged_[12].json
data/release/rejudged_run2.json
!data/release/rejudged_1.json
!data/release/rejudged_2.json
# The two row files the scoring scripts read alongside the bundle: the 100
# certified control seeds and the 535 released rows as the environment played
# them. `lineage_gap_from_exam.py` needs both, so a checkout without them
# cannot produce the lineage proof gap. Everything else under
# data/evaluation/exam/ stays ignored.
!data/evaluation/exam/
!data/evaluation/exam/seeds_all100.jsonl
!data/evaluation/exam/release535_playable.jsonl

