# Internal notes and review scratchpads that are not part of the public code release.
ORCHESTRATOR_QA_REPORT.md
PHASE*_COMPLETION.md
docs/*.md
!README.md
# `docs/` ships the three release reports (PDF) and nothing else. The working
# notes that once had exceptions here are drafting material -- design plans,
# failure post-mortems, terminology decisions -- written for ourselves, and
# naming them here published the titles without the documents.
# Third-party benchmarks we do not run experiments on. The two seed
# benchmarks we do use are under data/benchmarks/{minif2f_v2,proofnet_verified}.
data/benchmarks/external/

data/raw/*_notes.md
data/raw/*inventory*.md
data/raw/*recovery*.md
data/raw/SELECTION_NOTES.md
data/evaluation/treatment_inventory/final_curated/*.md
!release/huggingface/EML-1/README.md

